※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=4004

※ A parameter that does not say `mut` is what it was given and stays so, which
※ is the rule every other name follows.  The note points at the parameter, since
※ that is where saying otherwise would go.

fn f(n: u8) → u8:
    n ← 1u8
    n

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    f(3u8)
